OL,3,GNEWSATeacher struck off over sexual
OL,4,Arelationship with ex-pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school biology teacher has
OL,7,Fbeen struck off after a hearing found
OL,8,Fhe had had a sexual relationship with a
OL,9,Fformer pupil.
OL,11,FCallum Scott was employed by Dumfries
OL,12,Fand Galloway Council at the time.
OL,14,FA General Teaching Council for Scotland
OL,15,F(GTCS) panel concluded a string of
OL,16,Fallegations against him between 2017
OL,17,Fand 2020 were proven - including that
OL,18,Fhe saved explicit photographs of the
OL,19,Fex-pupil and threatened to send them to
OL,20,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
