OL,3,GNEWSATeacher struck off over sexual
OL,4,Arelationship with ex-pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt found his conduct had been "sexually
OL,7,Fmotivated" and agreed his name should
OL,8,Fbe removed from the teaching register.
OL,9,FHe can appeal against the decision
OL,10,Fwithin 28 days.
